# Migration to ZimaOS (casatozima)

- [x] Create the new project directory `casatozima`
- [x] Copy essential files from `flask-app` (Dockerfile, compose, src, requirements)
- [x] Create a clean `.gitignore` file
- [x] Initialize a new Git repository in `casatozima`
- [x] Add a migration guide/README to the new repository
- [x] (Optional) Create the repository on GitHub (Local setup ready, user to push)
- [x] Finalize the "clean" state for ZimaOS deployment

## 💿 ZimaOS Installation & USB Creation
- [ ] Download latest ZimaOS x86_64 installer image
- [ ] Create bootable USB using Rufus
- [/] Boot new PC from USB (Troubleshooting: Disk detection issue)
- [ ] Complete installation (Ensure AHCI mode in BIOS)
- [ ] Connect to ZimaOS dashboard on the local network
- [ ] Clone `casatozima` repo and run `docker compose up -d`
